// For the AddLeadingLists procedure.
//
// Returns:
//   Structure:
//     * AllFields       - Array
//     * AllFieldsTypes - Map of KeyAndValue:
//        ** Key - String - Field name.
//        ** Value - ValueStorage - Contains the "TypeDescription" type (field type).
//     * FieldsSets   - Structure:
