//                   **** Type - TypeDescription - field types.
//                   **** Use - Boolean - the field use.
//    * ByFIeldProperties - Map of KeyAndValue:
//        ** Key     - See NewFieldProperties
//        ** Value - Structure:
//             *** Table - String - a full name of an object table.
//             *** Field    - String - Field name.
